OL,3,GNEWSACity's readiness for Universal
OL,4,Araises concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised over whether
OL,7,Fa city near Universal's proposed new
OL,8,Ftheme park can cope with an estimated
OL,9,F8.5 million visitors a year when it
OL,10,Fopens in 2031.
OL,12,FCentral Milton Keynes is just 20
OL,13,Fminutes by car from where the resort
OL,14,Fwill be built at Kempston Hardwick.
OL,16,FConservative councillor Johnny Luk
OL,17,Fsaid: "We could have four times more
OL,18,Fvisitors on our doorstep than Alton
OL,19,FTowers and so far we have a readiness
OL,20,Fplan that is about one sentence long."
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
