OL,3,GNEWSACity's readiness for Universal
OL,4,Araises concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Liberal Democrat Jane
OL,7,FCarr insisted the authority was
OL,8,Fdeveloping a readiness plan, and added:
OL,9,F"We're working with businesses,
OL,10,Feducation providers and transport
OL,11,Fpartners to prepare for the
OL,12,Fopportunities and visitors that lie
OL,13,Fahead."
